@title Monorepo deployment pipeline
@subtitle Developer Productivity, Quillstone Software
@date 2026-10-10

## Pipeline diagram

diagram pipe dir=LR title="Monorepo deployment pipeline"

pipe: pr "Pull Request"
pipe: lint "Lint and Unit Tests"
pipe: build "Build Image"
pipe: scan "Security Scan"
pipe: staging "Deploy to Staging"
pipe: smoke "Smoke Tests"
pipe: approval "Manual Approval"
pipe: canary "Canary 10%"
pipe: full "Full Rollout"
pipe: rollback "Auto Rollback"
pipe: pr -> lint
pipe: lint -> build : pass
pipe: build -> scan
pipe: scan -> staging : no critical CVEs
pipe: staging -> smoke
pipe: smoke -> approval : pass
pipe: approval -> canary : approved
pipe: canary -> full : healthy 30 min
pipe: canary -> rollback : error rate above 1%

## Stage durations

data stages = Stage,Median minutes; Lint and Unit Tests,7.5; Build Image,4.2; Security Scan,2.8; Deploy to Staging,3.1; Smoke Tests,5.6; Canary 10%,30; Full Rollout,12

chart hbar stages x=Stage y=Median minutes unit=min labels title="Median duration by stage"

table = Stage,Median (min),p90 (min); Lint and Unit Tests,7.5,13.4; Build Image,4.2,6.9; Security Scan,2.8,4.1; Deploy to Staging,3.1,5.0; Smoke Tests,5.6,9.8; Canary 10%,30,30; Full Rollout,12,18

## Rules

- Manual Approval is required only for services tagged tier-1.
- Friday deploys after 15:00 local time are blocked.
- Auto Rollback pages the owning team.
